": 210, "width": 1000, "height": 800, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Ss", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 709322672, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 592284684}, {"id": "pp-1a-tab-t", "type": "text", "x": 93504, "y": 230, "width": 165, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1St", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Mesures desktop", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1652946993, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Mesures desktop", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1942024333, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pp-1a-tab-b", "type": "text", "x": 93504, "y": 274, "width": 952, "height": 340, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Su", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Fond Cream.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 600 \u00d7 450 centr\u00e9e (x 420, y 175), rayon \u2248 10, blanche.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo 300 \u00d7 450 \u00e0 gauche (fichier desktop 600 \u00d7 900, \u00e9cran 2\u00d7),\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0coins de gauche arrondis.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab PERFUME \u00bb Montserrat 500, 12 px, majuscules, espacement des\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0lettres 5 px, Grey ; marge 32 autour du texte.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Nom Fraunces 700, 32 px, Black, 3 lignes de 32 px.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe Montserrat 500, 14 px, Grey, 4 lignes de 23 px.\n6\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Prix Fraunces 700, 32 px, Green 500 ; ancien prix Montserrat 500,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a013 px, Grey, barr\u00e9, \u00e0 19 px du prix.\n7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Bouton \u00ab Add to Cart \u00bb 236 \u00d7 48, rayon \u2248 8, Green 500, ic\u00f4ne de\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0panier 15 \u00d7 16 + texte Montserrat 700, 14 px, blanc ; survol :\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Green 700 (etats.jpg).\n\nTailles cal\u00e9es : nom et prix 32 (\u2264 1 %, Fraunces avec taille optique)\n\u00b7 texte 14 \u00b7 bouton 14 \u00b7 \u00ab PERFUME \u00bb 12 + 5 px d'espacement.", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1728568315, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Fond Cream.\n1\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Carte 600 \u00d7 450 centr\u00e9e (x 420, y 175), rayon \u2248 10, blanche.\n2\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Photo 300 \u00d7 450 \u00e0 gauche (fichier desktop 600 \u00d7 900, \u00e9cran 2\u00d7),\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0coins de gauche arrondis.\n3\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab PERFUME \u00bb Montserrat 500, 12 px, majuscules, espacement des\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0lettres 5 px, Grey ; marge 32 autour du texte.\n4\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Nom Fraunces 700, 32 px, Black, 3 lignes de 32 px.\n5\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Paragraphe Montserrat 500, 14 px, Grey, 4 lignes de 23 px.\n6\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Prix Fraunces 700, 32 px, Green 500 ; ancien prix Montserrat 500,\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a013 px, Grey, barr\u00e9, \u00e0 19 px du prix.\n7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Bouton \u00ab Add to Cart \u00bb 236 \u00d7 48, rayon \u2248 8, Green 500, ic\u00f4ne de\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0panier 15 \u00d7 16 + texte Montserrat 700, 14 px, blanc ; survol :\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Green 700 (etats.jpg).\n\nTailles cal\u00e9es : nom et prix 32 (\u2264 1 %, Fraunces avec taille optique)\n\u00b7 texte 14 \u00b7 bouton 14 \u00b7 \u00ab PERFUME \u00bb 12 + 5 px d'espacement.", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 683108431, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pp-1b-t", "type": "text", "x": 92000, "y": 1210, "width": 385, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Sv", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 1002 (mobile.jpg)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 383457128, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "1B \u00b7 Mobile 375 \u00d7 1002 (mobile.jpg)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2053794290, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pp-img-m-cadre", "type": "rectangle", "x": 92000, "y": 1250, "width": 375, "height": 1002, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Sw", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 262855379, "strokeColor": "#ced4da", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1225404335}, {"id": "pp-1b-card", "type": "rectangle", "x": 92012.5, "y": 1330, "width": 350, "height": 750, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1Sx", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1734974618, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "strokeStyle": "dashed", "strokeWidth": 2, "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 584930420}, {"id": "pp-1b-card-m", "type": "ellipse", "x": 92346, "y": 1306, "width": 28, 