:1 texte)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 150087859, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pp-2b-b", "type": "text", "x": 93264, "y": 2446, "width": 1192, "height": 80, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 16, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1TI", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK, tous : nom Black 15,81:1 ; \u00ab Perfume \u00bb, paragraphe et ancien prix\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Grey 4,79:1 ; prix Green 500 4,67:1 ; bouton blanc sur Green 500\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a04,67:1 (11,33:1 survol\u00e9) ; attribution #3E52A3 sur Cream 6,04:1.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Ic\u00f4ne du panier : d\u00e9corative (le texte nomme le bouton).", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 1403406135, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "\u2022\u00a0\u00a0OK, tous : nom Black 15,81:1 ; \u00ab Perfume \u00bb, paragraphe et ancien prix\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Grey 4,79:1 ; prix Green 500 4,67:1 ; bouton blanc sur Green 500\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a04,67:1 (11,33:1 survol\u00e9) ; attribution #3E52A3 sur Cream 6,04:1.\n\u2022\u00a0\u00a0Ic\u00f4ne du panier : d\u00e9corative (le texte nomme le bouton).", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1438938267, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pp-2d-box", "type": "rectangle", "x": 91980, "y": 2632, "width": 2520, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5", "boundElements": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1TJ", "isDeleted": false, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "roughness": 0, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1698323660, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 3, "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 308845654}, {"id": "pp-2d-t", "type": "text", "x": 92000, "y": 2652, "width": 748, "height": 27.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 22, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1TK", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 796291779, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "2D \u00b7 Questions pour ta validation \u2014 ma proposition entre parenth\u00e8ses", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 754297911, "verticalAlign": "top"}, {"id": "pp-2d-b", "type": "text", "x": 92000, "y": 2696, "width": 2480, "height": 127.5, "angle": 0, "autoResize": true, "backgroundColor": "transparent", "boundElements": null, "containerId": null, "fillStyle": "solid", "fontFamily": 2, "fontSize": 17, "frameId": null, "groupIds": [], "index": "c1TL", "isDeleted": false, "lineHeight": 1.25, "link": null, "locked": false, "opacity": 100, "originalText": "Q-B1\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Add to Cart \u00bb sans action dans le challenge. (button type=\"button\", sans script ; ic\u00f4ne d\u00e9corative ; survol Green 700, focus visible.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Ancien prix barr\u00e9 : le barr\u00e9 n'est pas lu par les lecteurs d'\u00e9cran. (s pour l'ancien prix, avec \u00ab Current price: \u00bb et \u00ab Original price: \u00bb masqu\u00e9s \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Photo : elle montre le produit. (alt=\"Bottle of Gabrielle Essence Eau De Parfum among green leaves\" ; picture, photo mobile sous 640 px.)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Titres. (h1 = nom du produit ; \u00ab Perfume \u00bb en p au-dessus, en majuscules par le CSS.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (Carte desktop 600 \u00d7 450 centr\u00e9e d\u00e8s 640 px ; en dessous, la carte mobile, 350 px au plus, \u00e0 12 px des bords au moins, \u00e0 80 px du haut.)\nQ-B6\u00a0\u00a0Refonte. (M\u00eame d\u00e9p\u00f4t front-ui-cart en v2.0.0, historique gard\u00e9 ; GitHub Pages servi depuis gh-pages et non plus main ; \u00ab Edit solution \u00bb sur FM.)", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "seed": 923326523, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "strokeStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "text": "Q-B1\u00a0\u00a0\u00ab Add to Cart \u00bb sans action dans le challenge. (button type=\"button\", sans script ; ic\u00f4ne d\u00e9corative ; survol Green 700, focus visible.)\nQ-B2\u00a0\u00a0Ancien prix barr\u00e9 : le barr\u00e9 n'est pas lu par les lecteurs d'\u00e9cran. (s pour l'ancien prix, avec \u00ab Current price: \u00bb et \u00ab Original price: \u00bb masqu\u00e9s \u00e0 l'\u00e9cran.)\nQ-B3\u00a0\u00a0Photo : elle montre le produit. (alt=\"Bottle of Gabrielle Essence Eau De Parfum among green leaves\" ; picture, photo mobile sous 640 px.)\nQ-B4\u00a0\u00a0Titres. (h1 = nom du produit ; \u00ab Perfume \u00bb en p au-dessus, en majuscules par le CSS.)\nQ-B5\u00a0\u00a0Pas de maquette tablette. (Carte desktop 600 \u00d7 450 centr\u00e9e d\u00e8s 640 px ; en dessous, la carte mobile, 350 px au plus, \u00e0 12 px des bords au moins, \u00e0 80 px du haut.)\nQ-B6\u00a0\u00a0Refonte. (M\u00eame d\u00e9p\u00f4t front-ui-cart en v2.0.0, historique gard\u00e9 ; GitHub Pages servi depuis gh-pages et non plus main ; \u00ab Edit solution \u00bb sur FM.)", "textAlign": "left", "updated": 1793911574970, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 731518101, "verticalAlign": "top"}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {"pp-img-d-file": {"id": "pp-img-d-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793911563440}, "pp-img-e-file": {"id": "pp-img-e-file", "dataURL": "data:image/jpeg;base64,", "mimeType": "image/jpeg", "created": 1793911563440}, "pp-img-m-file": {"id": "